  {
    "id": 1013004010050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、この番組は\r\nなるべく早く入っておきたいから……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな\r\n原稿読みとはいえ、天気予報だもんな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、『もふ天』の時は気象予報士の方がいて\r\n私とカトレアはゲスト、という形だったけれど",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "今のコーナーは私一人だもの\r\n失敗出来ないわ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、『もふ天』のゲスト出演がこういう形で\r\n次に繋がるなんて思ってなかったけど",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "回を重ねるごとに大分\r\nお天気キャスターとして余裕が出てきたように見えるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら、そう？\r\n……ふふ、嬉しいわ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0220",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "プロデューサーにそう見えているなら\r\n上手くいってるってことだもの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん\r\nそれに反響もすごいんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "夕方の情報番組って、普段出演する媒体と\r\n少し視聴者層も違うからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今までよりもっと多くの人が、夏葉のことを\r\n知ってくれてるんだなって、最近特に感じるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "………………\r\n確かに",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "この間大学でも教授に聞かれたわ\r\n『君は気象予報士の資格を持っているのか？』って",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それまで芸能活動のことについて\r\n聞かれたことなんてなかったから、驚いたんだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、そうか\r\n番組、見てくれてるんだな",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……そうみたい",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "お天気のコーナーに出演させて貰っているんだから、\r\n資格を持っていたら……って私も思うけれど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それにはまだまだ、勉強が必要だわ\r\nもっと頑張らないとね",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……仕事に大学に、ワンマンライブの準備に\r\n十分過ぎるくらい頑張ってくれてるけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いいえ、足りないわ\r\nだって応援してもらっているんだもの、私",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1013004010170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……応え続けていかないと",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101300401/1013004010170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
